  "embedding_text": "新加坡贸易单证留存\n进口商与申报代理需按官方要求留存贸易单证至少五年，起点为许可批准日；发票、运输、装箱和相关证明应可追溯。\nSingapore Customs requires the trader and declaring agent to retain relevant trade documents for at least five years from permit approval, with specified conditions for digital copies.\nKeywords: 新加坡, 单证, 五年, 发票, 提单, retention"
